# Sale Contract Module

## Overview

Generates the Romanian official vehicle sale-purchase form — **ITL 054, Model 2026,
Anexa nr. 2**, "contract de înstrăinare-dobândire a unui mijloc de transport" — as a
downloadable PDF. Party details can be read off a photo of an identity document or
typed by hand; vehicle details come from the garage, from a photo of the registration
certificate, or by hand.

The contract works for a car in the user's garage **and** for one they are about to
buy, which is why `SaleContract.car_id` is nullable and every vehicle detail is
snapshotted onto the contract row. A contract is a historical record: editing the car
afterwards must never rewrite what the parties signed.

